Wrong (C): The $19,000 exclusion applies per beneficiary, not in total; with 4 beneficiaries the combined exclusion is $76,000, far exceeding the $40,000 premium.
Wrong (D): The $3,000,000 policy face value is not a gift; the grantor''s premium payment, not the death benefit, is the transfer subject to gift tax analysis.$EXPL$
